      "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Trọng lượng đèn là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N. Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tâm đáy, điều kiện cân bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cho <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>Trong tam giác đều <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, đường cao <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>35</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>Vậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xm